<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Full Tool Catalog</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T4" title="TABLE IV ‣ Appendix B Interactive Visualization Dashboard ‣ 6GAgentGym: Tool Use, Data Synthesis, and Agentic Learning for Network Management" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IV</span></a> lists all 42 tools with their typed signatures. Tools are grouped by effect category: Observation (read-only), Reasoning (pure computation), and Configuration (state-mutating).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Interactive Visualization Dashboard</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To support trajectory debugging and error analysis, we develop an interactive Streamlit-based dashboard that reads directly from NS-3 CSV traces. Fig. <a href="#S4.F5" title="Fig. 5 ‣ IV-E NS-3 Grounded Validation ‣ IV Experiments ‣ 6GAgentGym: Tool Use, Data Synthesis, and Agentic Learning for Network Management" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> illustrates its three primary views.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T4" class="ltx_table">
